gls(){return"Not enough evidence to judge"},
nK(a,b){return"Only "+a+" analysable sentence(s), where at least "+b+" are needed. At this length the statistical and sentence-level signals carry no weight, and forcing a score out of them would only mislead."},
nL(a,b){return"The text runs to "+a+" words, where at least "+b+" are needed. Below that, any writing trait could just be chance."},
nJ(a,b){return"Only "+a+" of "+b+" engines took part, so nothing can be cross-checked from a second angle. Fill in the missing models under model management and run it again."},
nI(a){return"The engines are "+a+" percentage points apart \u2014 far enough that averaging them stops meaning anything. Read the sentence evidence and the document's origin instead, and judge for yourself."},
