t4(a,b,c){return""+a+" words against "+b+" minutes of recorded editing works out to "+c+" words per minute, far above what anyone sustains while actually writing."},
t2(a){return"The file records almost no editing time at all, yet the body runs to "+a+" words."},
t1(a,b){return""+b+" words of content, saved only "+a+" time(s)."},
grT(){return"Worth knowing: these records can be wiped or reset \u2014 saving as a new file, converting online, exporting from Google Docs, or copying into a fresh document all zero them out. So a signal here is supporting evidence, never a conclusion on its own; and the absence of one does not prove a person wrote it."},
guU(){return"What this adds up to"},
