gtq(){return"Recheck this citation"},
gmj(){return"Matched by author, year, title, and venue across Crossref, OpenAlex, DataCite, Semantic Scholar, Europe PMC/PubMed/AGRICOLA, ERIC, DOAJ, and recognizable publisher catalogs. A high-confidence result requires a DOI registration or multiple consistent metadata fields; entries without a reliable match are marked as not verified. Google Scholar is available only as a user-initiated manual lookup because it does not provide automated API access."},
